sequenceDiagram
    title Sequence Diagram: Login & Autentikasi (Bearer Token)
    autonumber

    actor U as Pengguna
    participant FE as Frontend (React - Vercel)
    participant RT as Router (index.php)
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AU as Auth (Middleware)
    participant DB as Database (MySQL - TiDB Cloud)

    rect rgb(240, 249, 255)
    Note over U,DB: FASE 1 - Login (POST /api/auth/login)
    U->>FE: Isi username & password, klik "Login"
    FE->>RT: POST /api/auth/login { username, password }
    RT->>AC: dispatch ke AuthController::login()
    AC->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = :username
    DB-->>AC: baris user (atau kosong)

    alt user tidak ditemukan / password salah
        AC->>AC: password_verify(password, user.password) == false
        AC-->>RT: 401 Unauthorized
        RT-->>FE: "Username atau password salah"
        FE-->>U: Tampilkan pesan error
    else akun tidak aktif
        AC->>AC: cek user.status != 'Aktif'
        AC-->>RT: 403 Forbidden
        RT-->>FE: "Akun kamu nonaktif"
        FE-->>U: Tampilkan pesan error
    else login berhasil
        AC->>AU: Auth::generateToken(user.id)
        AU->>AU: token = bin2hex(random_bytes(32))<br/>expires_at = now() + 24 jam
        AU->>DB: INSERT INTO auth_tokens (user_id, token, expires_at)
        DB-->>AU: OK
        AU-->>AC: { token, expires_at }
        AC-->>RT: Response::success({ token, expires_at, user })
        RT-->>FE: 200 OK { token, expires_at, user }
        FE->>FE: Simpan token ke AuthContext / localStorage
        FE-->>U: Redirect ke Dashboard (sesuai role)
    end
    end

    rect rgb(254, 249, 195)
    Note over U,DB: FASE 2 - Request Terautentikasi Berikutnya (contoh: GET /api/siswa)
    U->>FE: Buka halaman modul (misal "Siswa")
    FE->>RT: GET /api/siswa<br/>Header: Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;
    RT->>AU: Auth::requireLogin()
    AU->>DB: SELECT u.*, at.expires_at FROM auth_tokens at<br/>JOIN users u WHERE at.token = :token
    DB-->>AU: baris user + expires_at (atau kosong)

    alt token tidak ditemukan
        AU-->>RT: 401 Unauthorized
        RT-->>FE: "Token tidak valid"
        FE-->>U: Redirect ke halaman Login
    else token kedaluwarsa
        AU->>AU: strtotime(expires_at) < time()
        AU-->>RT: 401 Unauthorized
        RT-->>FE: "Token sudah kedaluwarsa"
        FE-->>U: Redirect ke halaman Login
    else akun nonaktif
        AU-->>RT: 403 Forbidden
        RT-->>FE: "Akun tidak aktif"
    else token valid
        AU-->>RT: data user (id, role, status, dst.)
        RT->>RT: Lanjut ke Controller modul terkait
        RT-->>FE: 200 OK { data }
        FE-->>U: Tampilkan data modul
    end
    end
